sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Harness
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant S as Dispatcher
  participant M as MQTT Broker
  participant W as Worker
  participant O as Object storage
  participant I as Result Ingest
  H->>DB: Commit Task, tool correlation, action_id
  S->>DB: Commit Attempt and device occupancy
  S->>M: EXECUTE · QoS 1 · No retain · Validity
  M->>W: Command · May repeat
  W->>W: Validate scope, deadline, cancellation, deduplication
  W->>M: ACCEPTED
  M->>I: Acceptance event
  I->>DB: Persist acceptance
  W->>W: Execute and record result
  opt Large result
    W->>O: HTTPS upload with unique object key
  end
  W->>M: COMPLETED · event_id · output or reference
  M->>I: Terminal event · May repeat
  opt Artifact reference
    I->>O: Validate object and digest
  end
  I->>DB: Commit result dedupe, assignment check and state
  I->>M: RESULT_ACK
  M->>W: Acknowledge committed handling
  H->>DB: Read committed result and checkpoint
  H->>H: Continue or assess goal completion
